# PioniaCore

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before making changes.

- Core code lives in `src/Pionia/`; `example/` is dev-only (`autoload-dev`).
- API flow: Switch → Service → Action; register switches in `bootstrap/routes.php`.
- Use `ExceptionPipeline` via `$app->exceptions()` / `pionia_handle_exception()` — no ad-hoc catch blocks in kernel/switch.
- Use `report()` for logging throwables; use `logger()` / `LogManager` for channels.
- `GET /`: `public/index.html` wins, else `FrameworkWelcomePage`; framework assets at `/__pionia/`.
- Ship tests with every feature (`bin/test` on PHP 8.5+).
